# Without the method in the pattern, a POST reaches a read handler and is answered 200.

title: a write method reaches the read handler and is answered
file: internal/ledgerhttp/ledgerhttp.go
run: go test -count=1 -run TestAWriteMethodIsRefused -v ./internal/ledgerhttp/
--- before
	mux.HandleFunc("GET /v1/accounts/{code}", s.balance)
--- after
	mux.HandleFunc("/v1/accounts/{code}", s.balance)
